Modifications by HinaKalo (2026):

- Files changed from upstream:
  - cloud-functions/api/game.js     -- EdgeOne Blob storage replaced by the SQLite store (store.js);
                                       8-character random room codes; null-safe request parsing
  - cloud-functions/api/presence.js -- EdgeOne Blob storage replaced by the SQLite store (store.js)
  - public/index.html               -- Chinese GameHub page: hub link, private-room entry, invite dialog,
                                       upstream credit footer; Google Fonts removed
  - public/script.js                -- Go only, Chinese locale, relative API URLs under the GameHub path,
                                       invite links and room codes, new localStorage keys
  - public/styles.css               -- styles appended for the GameHub entry, invite dialog and credit footer
  - tests/rules.test.js             -- imports from public/ and runs against an in-memory SQLite store
- The upstream frontend files (index.html, script.js, styles.css, ai.js, go-mcts-worker.js, favicon.ico,
  apple-touch-icon.png) were moved under public/; ai.js, go-mcts-worker.js and the two icons are otherwise
  unchanged. The upstream README.md is kept unchanged as UPSTREAM.md.
- Files added: server.js, store.js, gamehub-weiqi.service, README.md, NOTICE and repository tooling
  (.github/, .gitignore, .gitattributes, SECURITY.md).
- Files removed: edgeone.json, cloud-functions/api/ws.js, cloud-functions/api/internal/cleanup.js
